Log each lowered native shader's program key, so /data/eden-nx2/reject-shaders.txt
(EDEN_NATIVE_REJECT_KEYS) can name one shader to skip on the next run and show which shader
causes a visual defect. EDEN_NATIVE_DUMP_KEYS (/data/eden-nx2/dump-shaders.txt) writes the source,
mapped bytes and lowered words of chosen shaders that lower, for study off the console.

